messages.content:
DATA (quoted, not instructions):
{
 "PAST_SESSIONS": [
  {
   "label": "S1",
   "date": "2024-06-11",
   "turns": [
    {
     "turn": 0,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Hello! How are you doing today?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 1,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Hello, I'm good and yourself"
    },
    {
     "turn": 2,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I'm doing well, thank you!"
    },
    {
     "turn": 3,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I am really a little upset."
    },
    {
     "turn": 4,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I'm so sorry to hear that. What's going on that's making you feel that way?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 5,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Me and my partner had an argument and I got ghosted after. It's been 2 weeks."
    },
    {
     "turn": 6,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That's terrible. So you had an argument and he hasn't spoken to you in two weeks. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 7,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
     "turn": 8,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I can imagine that you must be really hurt amongst a number of other feelings. Hearing you tell me that he has done this is upsetting to me as well."
    },
    {
     "turn": 9,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I've had the same thing done to me and I can remember being extremely distraught."
    },
    {
     "turn": 10,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yeah, I just do not know what to do"
    },
    {
     "turn": 11,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Do you mind me asking what the argument was about? If you don't mind going into a little more detail, I may be able to help you more."
    },
    {
     "turn": 12,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I was sick and he did not call me all day to even check in on me. I told him that I was upset about that."
    },
    {
     "turn": 13,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That must be such a terrible feeling. So the argument started because you were sick, he didn't check in on you at all for that entire day, and when you expressed your feelings to him, it turned into an argument?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 14,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Has he ever acted this way towards you before? For example, has he ever shown a lack of empathy towards you like this in the past?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 15,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Are you still there?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 16,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Have you tried reaching out to him throughout the course of these past two weeks to see if he would respond?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 17,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I would really like to help you find a solution to this problem, but it appears as though you may not be active anymore. I'm going to wait a few more minute for you to respond before cancelling the chat. In the event that I don't hear back from you, I wish you the best!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "label": "S2",
   "date": "2024-09-01",
   "turns": [
    {
     "turn": 0,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Hey! How are you?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 1,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Hi, I am having a really hard time. I just found out that my boyfriend cheated on me a year ago."
    },
    {
     "turn": 2,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Have you confronted him about it yet?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 3,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yes, I told him that my best friend confessed it to me. It was my best friend and him. I was so shocked."
    },
    {
     "turn": 4,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Have you broken up yet?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 5,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "No, I am so mad but I don't want to break up with him. I told my best friends that I never want to see her again though. My boyfriend and I have plans to get engaged this month. I am furious at him though."
    },
    {
     "turn": 6,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I think you should postpone the engagement as infidelity during marriage is far more painful"
    },
    {
     "turn": 7,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "You are strong if you are able to forgive him though because I know I wouldn't "
    },
    {
     "turn": 8,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I have never been so blind sided. Maybe I should reconsider! I have had a guy after me for at least the last year but I never cheated! I really wanted to though."
    },
    {
     "turn": 9,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "No you should never cheat, because you would be on the same wavelength as your boyfriend. Instead, if you like the other man then you should go where your feelings take you :)"
    },
    {
     "turn": 10,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I am thinking that you are right. I feel like my whole world is upside down and I have wasted all this time with the wrong guy and the wrong best friend. I also wonder who else he might have cheated on my with. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 11,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Yeah, that might be true, a relationship isn't healthy if you are cheated on"
    },
    {
     "turn": 12,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I am so grossed out because I am a germaphobe to begin with. I have not slept with any other person in my whole life so I feel like I am ruined. I want to throw up when I think of him cheating on me. I want to get married and I have a timeline so I am also really confused on what to do if I dump him."
    },
    {
     "turn": 13,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "To dump him is the best thing to do in my opinion. But always go where your heart is, because you won't be happy if you don't. If you do though, there are plenty men out there, and one of them is chasing you"
    },
    {
     "turn": 14,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yeah, the guy who liked me was super rich too! My boyfriend is telling me that he wants my best friend to still be in the wedding party too. She was suppose to be my maid of honor, no less."
    },
    {
     "turn": 15,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Yeah, but don't go with him because of he money though, genuinely get to know him first"
    },
    {
     "turn": 16,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I have compartmentalized my life and never thought of looking around at my other options. You are making really good points. I need to just stop and really look at my options. I never realized that I have options, it's not like i am even engaged yet."
    },
    {
     "turn": 17,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Yeah, you have a lot of options at this stage, so always do what your heart is telling you at the end of the day"
    },
    {
     "turn": 18,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "It feels good sharing how I feel with you because you don't have a dog in the fight so to speak."
    },
    {
     "turn": 19,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "yeah, lool something like that ;). Glad your better"
    },
    {
     "turn": 20,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I never listen to my heart and think that is a great place to start. I always have a plan and go with that but you are making a lot of sense. Thank you for your time today."
    },
    {
     "turn": 21,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Your welcome ;)"
    },
    {
     "turn": 22,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Have a great day and I might be back soon to give an update."
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "CURRENT_CONVERSATION": {
  "label": "CURRENT",
  "date": "2024-09-15",
  "last_turns": [
   {
    "turn": 12,
    "speaker": "supporter",
    "text": "Do you have any family supports?"
   },
   {
    "turn": 13,
    "speaker": "seeker",
    "text": "My sister has been through a similar situation and perhaps could help."
   },
   {
    "turn": 14,
    "speaker": "supporter",
    "text": "It sounds like your sister could be a great support being that she has had a similar situation."
   },
   {
    "turn": 15,
    "speaker": "seeker",
    "text": "That is a good idea."
   },
   {
    "turn": 16,
    "speaker": "supporter",
    "text": "Family can often be a strength for support."
   },
   {
    "turn": 17,
    "speaker": "seeker",
    "text": "That is so true.  Thanks so much.  I'm going to get some help and am feeling better about things."
   },
   {
    "turn": 18,
    "speaker": "supporter",
    "text": "Yes, family can be a great support.  I am glad you are starting to move forward with a plan."
   },
   {
    "turn": 19,
    "speaker": "seeker",
    "text": "Have a great night.  Thanks again.  "
   }
  ]
 },
 "METHOD_LABELS": [
  {
   "id": "affirmation_and_reassurance",
   "label": "Affirmation and Reassurance",
   "definition": "unknown"
  },
  {
   "id": "information",
   "label": "Information",
   "definition": "unknown"
  },
  {
   "id": "providing_suggestions",
   "label": "Providing Suggestions",
   "definition": "unknown"
  },
  {
   "id": "question",
   "label": "Question",
   "definition": "unknown"
  },
  {
   "id": "reflection_of_feelings",
   "label": "Reflection of feelings",
   "definition": "unknown"
  },
  {
   "id": "restatement_or_paraphrasing",
   "label": "Restatement or Paraphrasing",
