  },
  {
   "id": "self_disclosure",
   "label": "Self-disclosure",
   "definition": "unknown"
  }
 ]
}

DATA (quoted, not instructions):
{
 "PAST_SESSIONS": [
  {
   "label": "S1",
   "date": "2024-07-05",
   "turns": [
    {
     "turn": 0,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "How may I help you?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 1,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Hi I am feeling quite sad today."
    },
    {
     "turn": 2,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Ohh, sorry to hear that. Any partucular reason?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 3,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yes I feel like my friends just don't care about me much at all."
    },
    {
     "turn": 4,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "You saying that your friend does not care about you any more. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 5,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yes, when we get together all they want to do is talk about themselves. When I raise something that is bothering me they just ignore what I say and go back to what they want to talk about."
    },
    {
     "turn": 6,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That's not good. You must be feeling left out. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 7,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yes I feel left out and unsupported by them."
    },
    {
     "turn": 8,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Any particular reason they are doing such thing?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 9,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Well I think they don't care about me and are just selfish about their needs."
    },
    {
     "turn": 10,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "In that case, should you consider them as your friends?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 11,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Well they are the only friends I have and I have known them a long time. Do you think I should stop being friends with them ?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 12,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "If someone is not friendly they are not real friend. You need to find someone who will stand by you no matter what.."
    },
    {
     "turn": 13,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Oh well that makes me feel sad too.  I will be saying goodbye to some long friendships. Do you think that is the only answer ?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 14,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Ok.. how about hosting them in your place for a gettogether.. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 15,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Ok how do you think that would help me ?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 16,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "They might open up if you are hosting .. people are generally nice to the host.. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 17,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yes that is true, it's a good idea.  I could also take the opportunity to tell them how I am feeling."
    },
    {
     "turn": 18,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Good.. let's try that.. Anythign else I could help you with?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 19,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "No you have been very helpful and I feel much better now I have a plan of action to address my problem. Thanks."
    },
    {
     "turn": 20,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Thank you .. have a good day."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "label": "S2",
   "date": "2024-07-15",
   "turns": [
    {
     "turn": 0,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yo"
    },
    {
     "turn": 1,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Hi, how are you doing?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 2,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I am decent. I am here because my friend talks way too much on the phone, and it frustrates me."
    },
    {
     "turn": 3,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "They never want to hang up, and the talk can literally go on for hours."
    },
    {
     "turn": 4,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "It sounds like it would be quite frustrating for your friend to talk way too much on the phone. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 5,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "No, he loves it! I'm the one who hates it."
    },
    {
     "turn": 6,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "My goodness! How do they respond when you ask to end the conversation?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 7,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I tell him, but he just doesn't get it. Or, he says he understands, but then just goes back to talking!"
    },
    {
     "turn": 8,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Or, he may finally end the talk, but the next time we talk, he will just do it all over again!"
    },
    {
     "turn": 9,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I wonder what it would be like for him if you hung up the phone even after he said he still wanted to talk."
    },
    {
     "turn": 10,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Wow--that does sound annoying that he will repeat the same pattern the next time."
    },
    {
     "turn": 11,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "He will literally talk up to 10 minutes without letting you have a word in. As far as that advice, I have hung up, but he gets extremely offended easily."
    },
    {
     "turn": 12,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That sounds really difficult if he gets offended so easily. I find it hard to talk to some of those kinds of friends."
    },
    {
     "turn": 13,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I'm at my wits end. I tell him all the time. \"You talk too much. You gotta stop talking at me. You gotta give the other person a turn. You gotta respect other's time.\""
    },
    {
     "turn": 14,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "What do you get out of the friendship with this other person?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 15,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Well, I've been friends with him for a long time. He's funny and can have interesting perspectives on things. Also, we have done a lot together in the past."
    },
    {
     "turn": 16,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That sounds like a lot that the two of you have been through. Were there other times that your friends was more equally responsive or attuned to you in conversations?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 17,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Oh, yes, I have other friends in conversations who can take turns and understand the concept of time just fine."
    },
    {
     "turn": 18,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I just don't know what to do about this guy in particular. I still want to be his friend, but he just doesn't change."
    },
    {
     "turn": 19,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I wonder if there is anything nice you could do for yourself when you are talking to him that would make it easier to talk to him."
    },
    {
     "turn": 20,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Do you think I should just have a timer that goes off at 1 minute and let it beep in his face if he goes on for too long to train him like a monkey?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 21,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I can see that you are feeling upset and angry when he talks so much and that is totally understandable. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 22,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I just need a method. Talking to him is just not working."
    },
    {
     "turn": 23,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "He is hard to condition."
    },
    {
     "turn": 24,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Would it hurt his feelings to use a timer like that? It may for some other people. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 25,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yea, but I might be able to slip some humour in there to take the edge off because it is so silly."
    },
    {
     "turn": 26,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Humor is really helpful for a lot of people. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 27,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Any other ideas?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 28,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Sometimes, people draw or do something else distracting with their hands when talking to someone who dominates the conversation."
    },
    {
     "turn": 29,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "So your option is to start just doing something else when he is talking? He might get the message in a subtle way?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 30,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Sometimes that is a less offensive way to retrain someone who is being obnoxious or dominant and yet who is easily offended. And, it can help preserve your sense of being grounded."
    },
    {
     "turn": 31,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "The strategy works well for me with some of my family members who seem like they will never change. But, with distraction, I enjoy them all the more."
    },
    {
     "turn": 32,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "This is true, and it isn't bade advice. Haha! That is funny. Yes, maybe I should find something to carry around with me that I can enjoy."
    },
    {
     "turn": 33,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I don't really like to draw..."
    },
    {
     "turn": 34,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Is there anything else that you like to do that would be distracting while also letting you somewhat participate in the conversation?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 35,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yes, perhaps I should just use the internet when he starts talking too much. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 36,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I have a phone."
    },
    {
     "turn": 37,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That sounds really helpful. Sometimes people also play phone games or with a fidget spinner. I like your idea of looking on the internet."
    },
    {
     "turn": 38,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "This solves the problem in person, but it doesn't solve the talks over the phone, but it has been 15 minutes now and this has been helpful enough. Thank you for your solutions. You have been very supportive and kind to me"
    },
    {
     "turn": 39,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I don't want to take up any more of your time. It has been a good conversation. "
    },
    {
     "turn": 40,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "You are very welcome. I wish you all the best!"
    },
    {
     "turn": 41,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Goodbye. You as well."
    },
    {
     "turn": 42,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Bye!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "label": "S3",
   "date": "2024-08-05",
   "turns": [
    {
     "turn": 0,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Hey Jimmy, it's good to hear from you. How's everything on your end?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 1,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Hey, not too great to be honest. I tried opening up to my friends at the gathering I hosted, but it didn't go as I hoped."
    },
    {
     "turn": 2,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "I'm sorry to hear that, Jimmy. It sounds frustrating. Do you want to talk more about what happened?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 3,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yeah, I felt like I was finally ready to share some personal stuff, and it seemed like nobody wanted to listen or take it seriously."
    },
    {
     "turn": 4,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That must have been really tough, especially when you were putting yourself out there. How did you end up feeling after that?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 5,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I felt pretty down. It was like my feelings didn't matter to them, and it made me question if they really care about me."
    },
    {
     "turn": 6,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "It's completely understandable to feel that way. It sounds like you were looking for some support from your friends."
    },
    {
     "turn": 7,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Exactly. I just wanted someone to hear me out and maybe offer some advice or comfort."
    },
    {
     "turn": 8,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Feeling dismissed by friends could be really disheartening. Have you experienced anything like this before with them?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 9,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Not really. That's why it was kind of a shock. I just didn't expect it from them."
    },
    {
     "turn": 10,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That makes it even harder when it's unexpected. Was there anyone at the gathering who you felt did listen or understand?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 11,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "I think one of my friends was trying, but got caught up in someone else’s conversation. It wasn’t like they ignored me on purpose."
    },
    {
     "turn": 12,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "It sounds like they had a lot going on at the time. But still, it's important that they realize how that affected you."
    },
    {
     "turn": 13,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Yeah, I hope I can talk to them about how I felt. I'm just not sure how to bring it up without making it awkward."
    },
    {
     "turn": 14,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "It's definitely a delicate subject, but expressing how you feel is also important. Maybe you could start by mentioning how much their support means to you?"
    },
    {
     "turn": 15,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "That's a good idea. I guess I could tell them that it would really mean a lot to me if they could be there for me when I need it."
    },
    {
     "turn": 16,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "That sounds like a thoughtful way to start the conversation. Remember, real friends will want to support you when they know something's up."
    },
    {
     "turn": 17,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Thanks, I really appreciate that. It helps to talk it through and feel a bit more prepared."
    },
    {
     "turn": 18,
     "speaker": "supporter",
     "text": "Anytime, Jimmy. I'm here for you if you need to chat more. You're doing great by taking the steps to communicate how you feel."
    },
    {
     "turn": 19,
     "speaker": "seeker",
     "text": "Thanks, it means a lot. I'll let you know how it goes."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "label": "S4",
   "date": "2024-08-15",
   "turns": [
    {
     "turn": 0,
     "speaker": "supporter",
